Human: Can you tell me the steps to write an if/then statement in C programming language?

Assistant: Sure, here’s how you could write an if/then statement in C:

if (condition1) {
    // code to execute if condition1 is true
} else if (condition2) {
    // code to execute if both condition1 and condition2 are true
} else {
    // code to execute if none of the above are true
}
